reg 20241620 art 11 par 1 has the legal text "The Authority shall establish and keep up to date a central database of information pursuant to this Article. The Authority shall make the information available to supervisory authorities, non-AML/CFT authorities, other national authorities and competent bodies, and to the European Supervisory Authorities, on a need-to-know and confidential basis. The Authority shall also analyse the collected information and may share the results of its analysis.".


